oes</strong>.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"696\" data-end=\"699\">\r\n<h3 data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"718\"><strong data-start=\"705\" data-end=\"718\">Kenmerken</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<li data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"758\">\r\n<p data-start=\"721\" data-end=\"758\">Titel: <strong data-start=\"728\" data-end=\"758\">Starlink: Battle for Atlas</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"759\" data-end=\"790\">\r\n<p data-start=\"761\" data-end=\"790\">Platform: <strong data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"790\">Nintendo Switch</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"791\" data-end=\"835\">\r\n<p data-start=\"793\" data-end=\"835\">Genre: Action / Adventure / Space Combat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"876\">\r\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"876\">Bouw en upgrade je eigen ruimteschip</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"877\" data-end=\"929\">\r\n<p data-start=\"879\" data-end=\"929\">Verken verschillende planeten en sterrenstelsels</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"930\" data-end=\"982\">\r\n<p data-start=\"932\" data-end=\"982\">Bevat <strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"967\">exclusieve Switch-content</strong> met Star Fox</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"983\" data-end=\"1015\">\r\n<p data-start=\"985\" data-end=\"1015\">Inclusief <strong data-start=\"995\" data-end=\"1013\">originele hoes</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1036\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1036\"><strong data-start=\"1018\" data-end=\"1036\">In nette staat</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1067\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1067\"><strong data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1067\">Incl. 1 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1164\">Een unieke mix van ruimtegevechten, verkennen en bouwen deaal voor sci-fi en actiegame fans!</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
